From: jyejax <jyeridley@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:34:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Xitter Pro: filters, alerts, shortcuts and settings, as
 on X Pro

Columns: Following (chronological) and Mentions; filters on search, profile
and Following columns (content type, replies, people you follow, minimum
likes, reposts and replies, Top or Latest) written as search operators;
renaming, duplicating and auto-refresh while scrolled to the top.
Alerts: the client's unread count on notification columns and in the
deck's title, with an optional sound and desktop notification.
Keyboard shortcuts (columns pass the number and bracket keys on), a
settings dialog, deck export and import, duplicating and reordering decks,
and #deck= links.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Q7yi9Zfn84VdgZ5F35UQL9
